---
title: Progress
description: Styled native progress element for determinate and indeterminate states. Always pair it with a label so the value is announced.
tags: [feedback, css]
---

<link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css" media="screen">

<label for="upload">Uploading</label>
<progress id="upload" class="progress" value="65" max="100">65%</progress>

<label for="loading">Loading</label>
<progress id="loading" class="progress">Loading</progress>
